Natasha L.: thanks — I'll push a WIP PR with the network-interceptor change and updated shadow rules, link coming in a bit. Jordan, can you eyeball the shadow transformer config? 

Jordan K.: Yep I'll review. If possible avoid relocating okhttp core (we prefer shading only transitive libs). I'll also add the follow-up integration test.

